        {
          "id": 1194372680,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Yes.\n\nI used `tvb_strsize` because that includes the NULL terminator in the length (and `tvb_strnlen`, which does not throw an exception, does not include the NULL). Using `tvb_strnlen` would also mean adding several other checks designed to prevent bounds errors, which I thought was cleaner to handle all at once with the exception.",
